---
/**
 * TeachContent — "What We Teach" page body, bilingual.
 */
import ApproachSection from '@components/ApproachSection.astro';
---
<ApproachSection background="warm">
  <div slot="en">
    <p class="label">What we teach</p>
    <h1>English, writing, and the habits of mind behind them.</h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      We teach secondary and post-secondary students one at a time, in English
      and Traditional Chinese. The subjects are literature, writing, and
      critical thinking. The method is inquiry-based. The work is real.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <p class="label">教學內容</p>
    <h1>英文、寫作，以及背後那些思考的習慣。</h1>
    <p class="body-lg">
      我們一對一陪中學生與大學生上課，英文或繁體中文都行。
      科目主要是文學、寫作、批判思考。方法是探究式學習。作品都是真的。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>English literature and language.</h2>
    <p>
      Close reading of novels, essays, poetry, and graphic texts. We talk
      through what we notice. We argue about what it means. We write essays
      that take a position and defend it.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>英文文學與英文語言。</h2>
    <p>
      細讀小說、散文、詩、圖像文本。我們把看到的東西講出來，為意思辯論，再寫出能站得住腳的文章。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection background="surface">
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Academic writing and research.</h2>
    <p>
      Structure, evidence, and voice. Students learn to narrow a topic, find
      reliable sources, cite them properly, and write prose a professor
      actually wants to read. We use academic databases and research tools
      together.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>學術寫作與研究方法。</h2>
    <p>
      結構、證據、聲音，三者一起練。學生學會把主題聚焦、找到可信的資料、正確引用，
      寫出教授真的願意讀的那種文字。我們會一起用學術資料庫和研究工具。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Critical thinking and analytical writing.</h2>
    <p>
      We practise asking questions that open the conversation instead of
      closing it. Students learn to test claims, compare sources, weigh
      evidence, and notice their own assumptions. The writing that comes
      out of that is different.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>批判思考與分析寫作。</h2>
    <p>
      我們練習的是「能打開對話」的問題，不是把話講死的問題。
      學生學著驗證主張、比較來源、衡量證據，也看見自己原本的假設。
      從這裡寫出來的文章，味道不一樣。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection background="surface">
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Tests and applications, when they come up.</h2>
    <p>
      SAT Reading &amp; Writing, IELTS, and university applications are part
      of student life. We prepare for them, and we do it without losing the
      rest of what matters. Practice tests are a tool, not the curriculum.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>考試與申請，用得上的時候會練。</h2>
    <p>
      SAT 英文、IELTS、大學申請都是學生會碰到的事，我們該練就練。
      不過練考試是工具，不是課程主軸。我們不會為了考試，把真正重要的東西丟掉。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>

<ApproachSection>
  <div slot="en">
    <h2>Who it's for.</h2>
    <p>
      Students in secondary and post-secondary school, based anywhere with
      a reliable internet connection. We work in English, Traditional
      Chinese, or a mix, depending on what the student needs. IB teaching
      principles inform everything; students don't need to be in an IB
      programme to benefit.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div slot="zh">
    <h2>誰適合上這樣的課。</h2>
    <p>
      中學或大學的學生，住在哪裡都行，只要網路穩。
      上課可以全英、全中、或中英夾雜，看學生需要什麼。
      我們受 IB 教學理念的影響很深，但學生不需要念 IB 才能受益。
    </p>
  </div>
</ApproachSection>
